Trace every message SENT to the SEP (TZ0 / IMG4 / SET_SHMEM, incl. addresses).

Companion to sep-trace-rx: log the three outgoing boot messages so the dmesg
shows the full conversation (what we send vs. what -- if anything -- comes back).
Lets us confirm fw_addr/shm_addr are sane and correlate each TX with its ACK.

